# Open-source repository root.
#
# Only distributable plugin code is published. Development-only content stays
# out of the repository and never reaches the remote.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/dsh-eval-harness/

# Development-only directories are excluded everywhere, including inside the
# published folder: design docs, benchmark checkouts, run artifacts and
# reference implementations are local working material.
# Note: the plugin source directory `src/benchmark/` is distribution code and
# must stay tracked; only the plural `benchmarks/` data roots are ignored.
docs/
benchmarks/
runs/
reference/
